function.arguments:
{"command":"bash -lc 'set -e; cd ~/hermes-brain; ./scripts/auto_sync.sh; CURRENT=$(git rev-parse HEAD); PREV=$(git rev-parse HEAD~1); SUBJECT=$(git log -1 --format "%s"); REMOTE=$(git remote get-url origin); OWNER_REPO=$(echo "$REMOTE" | sed -E "s#.*github.com[:/](.+?)(\\.git)?$#\\1#"); COMPARE_URL="https://github.com/$OWNER_REPO/compare/$PREV...$CURRENT"; COMMIT_URL="https://github.com/$OWNER_REPO/commit/$CURRENT"; STAT=$(git diff HEAD~1 HEAD --stat); FILES_CHANGED=$(echo "$STAT" | awk '/files changed/ {print $1; exit}'); INSERTIONS=$(echo "$STAT" | awk '/insertions/ {print $(NF-1); exit}'); DELETIONS=$(echo "$STAT" | awk '/deletions/ {print $(NF-1); exit}'); NAME_STATUS=$(git diff HEAD~1 HEAD --name-status); ADDED_COUNT=$(echo "$NAME_STATUS" | awk '\''$1=="A"{c+=1} END{print c+0}'\' ); MOD_COUNT=$(echo "$NAME_STATUS" | awk '\''$1=="M"{c+=1} END{print c+0}'\' ); ADDED_LIST=$(echo "$NAME_STATUS" | awk '\''$1=="A"{print $2}'\'); MOD_LIST=$(echo "$NAME_STATUS" | awk '\''$1=="M"{print $2}'\'); DATE=$(date -u +"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ"); HOSTNAME=$(hostname); cat > /tmp/telegram_report.txt <<EOF
✅ Hermes Brain 同步完成

🎯 核心更新摘要：
• 变更文件数: ${FILES_CHANGED:-0}, 插入: ${INSERTIONS:-0}, 删除: ${DELETIONS:-0}
• 最新提交: ${CURRENT:0:7} - ${SUBJECT}
• Compare: ${COMPARE_URL}
• Commit: ${COMMIT_URL}

📋 变更详情：
• 文件变更: ${FILES_CHANGED:-0} 个，${INSERTIONS:-0} 行新增，${DELETIONS:-0} 行删除
• 新增文件: ${ADDED_COUNT:-0} 个
  - ${ADDED_LIST//$'\n'/\n  - }
• 修改文件: ${MOD_COUNT:-0} 个
  - ${MOD_LIST//$'\n'/\n  - }

🔗 快速导航：
👉 查看本次详细变更: ${COMPARE_URL}
👉 查看提交详情: ${COMMIT_URL}

🏢 ${HOSTNAME} ⏰ ${DATE}
EOF
echo REPORT_READY'"}
